{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dear Marie,\n\nI am now sitting in the inn in Weimar and writing to you briefly from the park by the Ilm, which was lovely today. At around two o'clock I was at Goethe's table, seated right next to him. Mrs. Goethe was absent, as she is due to give birth soon, but the company was numerous: Miss von Pogwisch, Court Councillor Vogel, Dr. Emmerich, the two grandchildren, his son, and Zelter.\n\nWe spoke a great deal about politics and literature in France; Goethe listens attentively and asks about the latest trends there. It was a pleasant, quiet gathering.\n\nIn the evening I was at the theater. The evening is now quiet. Think of me.\n\nYours\nHegel"}}],"created":1795221245,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":164,"prompt_tokens":230,"total_tokens":394,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-4OU0vgGCCCLBMMekU9TLrdPjezk6Plea","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":230,"prompt_ms":492.886,"prompt_per_token_ms":2.1429826086956525,"prompt_per_second":466.6393445948961,"predicted_n":164,"predicted_ms":3852.919,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.63753987730061,"predicted_per_second":42.305587010783256}}